## Quick Start

```bash
# 1. Configure your API key
export {{ if eq (.vars.provider | default "anthropic") "anthropic" }}ANTHROPIC_API_KEY{{ else if eq .vars.provider "openai" }}OPENAI_API_KEY{{ else if eq .vars.provider "deepseek" }}DEEPSEEK_API_KEY{{ else }}OLLAMA_HOST{{ end }}="your-key-here"

# 2. Start the campaign daemon
guild daemon start

# 3. Create a new commission
guild commission create my-feature

# 4. Start working
guild work my-feature
```

