## Common Commands

```bash
# Campaign Management
guild status                  # Check campaign status
guild daemon start            # Start background daemon
guild daemon stop             # Stop daemon

# Commission Management
guild commission create NAME  # Create new commission
guild commission list         # List all commissions
guild commission refine NAME  # Refine a commission

# Work Execution
guild work COMMISSION         # Start working on commission
guild work --guild=research   # Use specific guild

# Knowledge Base
guild corpus add FILE         # Add to knowledge base
guild corpus search QUERY     # Search knowledge base
```

## Configuration

### Provider Setup

Edit `.campaign/campaign.yaml` to configure your AI provider:

```yaml
providers:
  anthropic:
    api_key_env: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
    default_model: claude-3-sonnet-20240229
```

### Custom Agents

Add new agents in `.campaign/agents/`:

```yaml
id: my-custom-agent
name: "Custom Agent"
type: worker
provider: anthropic
model: claude-3-sonnet-20240229
capabilities:
  - my-custom-capability
```

### Custom Guilds

Create guild configurations in `.campaign/guilds/`:

```yaml
guild:
  name: my-custom-guild
  version: "1.0.0"
manager:
  default: guild-master
agents:
  - guild-master
  - my-custom-agent
```

